# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The app is a single-page app: every route lives behind the hash router and
# /index.html must answer any path that is not a real file. Without this, a
# reload on a deep link returns a 404 from the CDN.
#
# 200 means "rewrite", not "redirect": the URL in the address bar stays put.
/*    /index.html   200
